<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net sellers of S.Africa bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of S.Africa bonds last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of 196.39 million rand worth of South African bonds last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				 Week to Sept 6    Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		   3,875.59	111,792.34</p>
<p>    - sales			 4,071.98	109,866.67</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)    (196.39)	 1,925.68</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
